Notebook[{

Cell[CellGroupData[{
Cell["Infra Analysis", "GuideTitle",
 CellID->942062912,ExpressionUUID->"a3a3c038-ca24-47b7-9945-83f1c1312fe3"],

Cell["\<\
Tangent spaces and differential forms: the first-order structure of a \
substrate, with the tangent space at a vertex, the displacements that move \
its vertices, the differential forms and cochains, and the tautological \
1-form. A displacement of scale r sends each vertex to a set of vertices \
within distance r, a discrete flow for time r, and it is multivalued by \
design. Its operations are metric: scaling moves along the geodesics from \
each vertex to its images, the sum is the bisector of the two orders of \
composition, and the commutator is the loop of the two displacements and \
their inverses, or of their metric negatives. A form is a germ of values at a \
vertex on tuples of its neighbours, a cochain a value on the cliques of the \
graph; the restriction and integration maps pass between the two, and the \
coboundary, the differential, the wedge and the cup products act on them. The \
tangent space and the tautological 1-form still wait: both exist in the \
InfraGaugeTheory paclet and are to be copied here.\
\>", "GuideAbstract",
 CellID->2001916300,ExpressionUUID->"ef0ab37b-2e0d-4399-8f7e-82603ccbe925"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["", "GuideFunctionsSection",
 CellID->1866139230,ExpressionUUID->"a0ea3657-4c83-4862-93c8-ecf80cebc774"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Tangent spaces", "GuideFunctionsSubsection",ExpressionUUID->"bfece976-aa75-4c56-9cd7-3cf6bcaf5415"],

Cell["\<\
waits: the tangent space at a vertex, copied from InfraGaugeTheory, where it \
is GraphTangentBundle and TangentFiberedGraph\
\>", "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"f0848aa2-edca-4c32-b109-4edfbc30d948"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Displacements", "GuideFunctionsSubsection",ExpressionUUID->"2ab95360-6d51-4a3c-8bf6-497a844742d2"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["DisplacementCompose",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " \[LongDash] composes displacements as flows, the leftmost acting first"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"79d86c7c-f2bf-43c0-bfd2-dc1160163b0b"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["DisplacementScale",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " \[LongDash] scales a displacement by t along the geodesics from each \
vertex to its images; t < 0 reflects through the base point"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"7f216563-603b-470e-806e-080dfefa46c2"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["DisplacementNegative",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " \[LongDash] the metric negative of a displacement, each step reflected \
through its base point"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"a8d6fa0b-226f-4350-a2cc-11785178308e"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["DisplacementInverse",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " \[LongDash] the reversed relation, the inverse when the displacement is \
bijective"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"89fc24ae-48b7-420e-99d4-a2eec9c0224f"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["DisplacementSum",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " \[LongDash] the bisector of the two orders of composition of two \
displacements"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"05bf5278-2727-44b1-8b20-01b82b1ac809"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["DisplacementCommutator",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " \[LongDash] the commutator loop of two displacements, by their inverses or \
by their metric negatives"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"defd9ef6-66bd-4d15-a6e1-a5fc05c88d20"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["DisplacementBracket",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " \[LongDash] the commutator by metric negatives, the scale-dependent bracket"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"5879bd69-9b6f-4f9d-89d7-4073c168206f"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["DisplacementMagnitude",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " \[LongDash] the largest step of a displacement, its scale"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"6754102f-9ea4-45b8-8f94-593dde92f638"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["DisplacementReduce",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " \[LongDash] contracts each value set of a displacement to its metric \
centre, iterated to a fixed point"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"e890448c-c926-4d56-8de8-0d511fca44fb"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Kinds of displacements", "GuideFunctionsSubsection",ExpressionUUID->"93dfb1b7-105f-4c58-97ed-afb6755a64f5"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["DisplacementSingleValuedQ",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " \[LongDash] whether every value of a displacement is a single vertex"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"4c650b3d-893f-4542-93f1-461dfe76ba29"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["DisplacementBijectionQ",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " \[LongDash] whether a displacement is a single-valued permutation of the \
vertices"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"eb4ab302-4e7b-44c1-a737-a53afde588af"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["DisplacementIsomorphismQ",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " \[LongDash] whether a displacement is a graph automorphism, a discrete \
Killing displacement"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"ffb57536-a849-47b2-a036-34003fb260bd"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["ContinuousDisplacementQ",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " \[LongDash] whether a displacement is k-continuous, in the weak, Hausdorff \
or strong sense"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"aede60b7-ae8a-4543-960b-3500fcafc5c4"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["FindKillingDisplacement",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " \[LongDash] the nontrivial automorphism of least magnitude, as a \
displacement"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"76913a35-ac02-4d88-acf3-e13029e74013"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["KillingDisplacementMagnitude",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " \[LongDash] the least magnitude of a nonidentity automorphism, Infinity on \
an asymmetric graph"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"368a7599-7390-42f6-88bb-f96deaf88703"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Canonical displacements", "GuideFunctionsSubsection",ExpressionUUID->"018c59b2-c1e2-45cb-8788-d7a473312a9d"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["RandomDisplacement",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " \[LongDash] a random continuous displacement of magnitude at most r"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"856edb9b-a888-4ad7-95d1-8bbf49c0e35f"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["PolarDisplacements",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " \[LongDash] the radial and the angular displacement about a centre"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"b56fca4b-5b85-4af1-9cae-cf590280f3bf"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["GradientDisplacement",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " \[LongDash] the steepest-ascent displacement of a vertex function"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"1835bb8a-a849-49f0-8018-8f37273a118a"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["TranslationDisplacement",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " \[LongDash] the translation by a vector of the graph embedding, each \
vertex moved to the nearest vertices"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"0cb44cfb-fcef-47a6-82b0-fd6a09781949"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["DisplacementPlot",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " \[LongDash] a displacement, or a sequence of them, drawn as bent arcs over \
the graph"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"94ea1f4d-9b36-44d1-a9c5-8312d11874c3"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Forms and cochains", "GuideFunctionsSubsection",ExpressionUUID->"d71f7b51-184c-4e25-9f77-01ac91a1c1e4"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["FormValue",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " \[LongDash] the value of the germ of a form at a vertex on a tuple of its \
neighbours, alternating in the tuple"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"adb73191-bb75-4b59-b00d-378a80f1c5cf"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["CochainValue",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " \[LongDash] the value of an alternating cochain on a vertex tuple"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"e4e80cab-fe81-4020-aa74-45dac4728d21"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["OrderedCochainValue",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " \[LongDash] the value of an ordered cochain on an increasing vertex tuple"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"5093ac96-3e0c-4318-9b15-6732851751f5"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["FormDegree",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " \[LongDash] the degree of a form"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"55f2395f-2d37-43f2-8538-2c75c4fc1a2f"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["CochainDegree",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " \[LongDash] the degree of a cochain"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"c1ecdfba-77db-4bac-a8a0-9baaee24ac05"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["ZeroForm",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " \[LongDash] a vertex function as a 0-form"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"c4618e77-6b36-4844-94fc-f517abe41185"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["RestrictionMap",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " \[LongDash] the form read from an alternating cochain with the base vertex \
prepended"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"44d3eacf-693f-4438-afb5-5480f214f3b7"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["IntegrationMap",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " \[LongDash] the cochain averaged from the germs of a form over each \
clique, a left inverse of RestrictionMap"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"b3dae872-3ddd-4bf6-b55c-d22276b64a4a"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["Coboundary",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " \[LongDash] the coboundary of a cochain, the alternating sum over the \
faces of every clique one dimension up"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"2c2b4b58-a4f3-4048-807c-7408bd239bc8"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["FormDifferential",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " \[LongDash] the differential of a form, the gradient on 0-forms and with a \
transport term on 1-forms"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"2e274beb-a4fc-44fb-b9c6-812d954c3cca"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["NaiveDifferential",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " \[LongDash] the differential of a 1-form with the transport term dropped, \
kept for comparison"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"eb2a8188-3cd0-499d-9939-3b74954ec230"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["FormWedge",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " \[LongDash] the wedge product of forms, fibre by fibre"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"a2739a56-a06b-4d4d-a0a2-7fbea90ab2b9"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["CochainCup",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " \[LongDash] the cup product of alternating cochains, antisymmetrised over \
the orderings of each clique"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"2251e49a-9b1c-4846-b464-59362670aef9"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["OrderedCochainCup",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " \[LongDash] the Alexander-Whitney cup product of ordered cochains"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"73e41b7d-23d8-43d7-b398-d46ac8d24537"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["CochainCupOne",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " \[LongDash] the Steenrod cup-1 product of ordered cochains"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"15567875-c31a-4986-af41-342e60bddd3b"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["AntisymmetrizedCup",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " \[LongDash] an alias of CochainCup"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"c1e1b1e7-c4a8-4a1e-a246-435ab8aded90"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["The tautological 1-form", "GuideFunctionsSubsection",ExpressionUUID->"c0632cb7-3f1f-4558-9e81-2821ec227217"],

Cell["\<\
waits: the cotangent space and the tautological 1-form, copied from \
InfraGaugeTheory, where they are GraphCotangentBundle, CotangentFlip, \
InfraTautologicalSection and InfraTautologicalOneForm, the last evaluated by \
InfraCanonicalOneForm\
\>", "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"782be8fd-1564-433b-877f-1f94195b3f65"]
}, Open  ]]
}, Open  ]],

